        {
            "id": "https://xubiaolin.github.io/2025/11/05/huan-jing-wen-ti/openwrt-an-zhuang-tailscale/",
            "url": "https://xubiaolin.github.io/2025/11/05/huan-jing-wen-ti/openwrt-an-zhuang-tailscale/",
            "title": "OpenWrt安装Tailscale",
            "date_published": "2025-11-05T06:21:34.000Z",
            "content_html": "<h1 id=\"前言\"><a href=\"#前言\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前言\"></a>前言</h1><p>Openwrt自带的包管理器无法安装tailscale，需要手动进行安装</p>\n<h1 id=\"安装tailscale\"><a href=\"#安装tailscale\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"安装tailscale\"></a>安装tailscale</h1><h2 id=\"下载tailscale包\"><a href=\"#下载tailscale包\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"下载tailscale包\"></a>下载tailscale包</h2><p>访问：<a href=\"https://pkgs.tailscale.com/stable/#static\">https://pkgs.tailscale.com/stable/#static</a></p>\n<p>下载对应系统的tailscale包到OpenWrt，下面我以amd64的为例</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">https://pkgs.tailscale.com/stable/tailscale_1.90.6_amd64.tgz</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<p>解压</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">tar -xvf tailscale_1.90.6_amd64.tgz</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"安装tailscale-1\"><a href=\"#安装tailscale-1\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"安装tailscale\"></a>安装tailscale</h2><figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">mv tailscale /usr/bin/tailscale</span><br><span class=\"line\">mv tailscaled /usr/bin/tailscaled</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">chmod +x /usr/bin/tailscale /usr/bin/tailscaled</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"创建必要的目录和配置\"><a href=\"#创建必要的目录和配置\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"创建必要的目录和配置\"></a>创建必要的目录和配置</h2> <figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">mkdir -p /var/lib/tailscale /var/run</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"设置开机自启\"><a href=\"#设置开机自启\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"设置开机自启\"></a>设置开机自启</h2><p>创建启动脚本 /etc/init.d/tailscale：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">#!/bin/sh /etc/rc.common</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">USE_PROCD=1</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">START=99</span><br><span class=\"line\">STOP=10</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">start_service() {</span><br><span class=\"line\">    procd_open_instance</span><br><span class=\"line\">    procd_set_param command /usr/bin/tailscaled \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">        --state=/var/lib/tailscale/tailscale.state \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">        --socket=/var/run/tailscale/tailscaled.sock \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">        --tun=userspace-networking</span><br><span class=\"line\">    procd_set_param respawn</span><br><span class=\"line\">    procd_set_param stdout 1</span><br><span class=\"line\">    procd_set_param stderr 1</span><br><span class=\"line\">    procd_close_instance</span><br><span class=\"line\">}</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">service_triggers() {</span><br><span class=\"line\">    procd_add_reload_trigger \"tailscale\"</span><br><span class=\"line\">}</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p>赋予权限并启用：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">chmod +x /etc/init.d/tailscale</span><br><span class=\"line\">/etc/init.d/tailscale enable</span><br><span class=\"line\">/etc/init.d/tailscale start</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<p>之后就可以用标准命令管理：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">service tailscale restart</span><br><span class=\"line\">service tailscale status</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"后续使用\"><a href=\"#后续使用\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"后续使用\"></a>后续使用</h2><p>登录：<code>tailscale up</code></p>\n<p>查看状态：<code>tailscale status</code></p>\n<p>退出：<code>tailscale down</code></p>\n<h1 id=\"常见问题与注意事项\"><a href=\"#常见问题与注意事项\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"常见问题与注意事项\"></a>常见问题与注意事项</h1><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>tailscale: not found</code></td>\n<td>确保二进制是静态链接且架构正确，可用 <code>file /usr/bin/tailscale</code> 检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>missing tun device</code></td>\n<td>安装 <code>kmod-tun</code> 并运行 <code>insmod tun</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存不足</td>\n<td>使用外接存储 + extroot，避免 jffs2 分区空间不足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能较差</td>\n<td><code>userspace-networking</code> 模式较慢，建议仅用于控制、远程访问，不适合高吞吐场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n",
            "tags": [
                "OpenWrt",
                "Tailscale"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "https://xubiaolin.github.io/2025/09/27/huan-jing-wen-ti/mosdns-da-pei-oc-de-liu-liang-fen-liu/",
            "url": "https://xubiaolin.github.io/2025/09/27/huan-jing-wen-ti/mosdns-da-pei-oc-de-liu-liang-fen-liu/",
            "title": "Mosdns搭配OC的流量分流",
            "date_published": "2025-09-27T10:40:12.000Z",
            "content_html": "<p>1、打开mosdns的设置，点启用，勾选dns转发接管dnsmaq，不用自定义国内，用wan口获得的运营商dns就行<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/refs/heads/master/5030c46b3dc3cb4d5fb4439bc2c3a778b338fce781b78c58792cb58ec94351b9.png\" alt=\"picture 3\">  </p>\n<p>2、mosdns高级选项，服务器数量改2或以上，勾选防泄露和启用缓存，有需要可以加个广告过滤的订阅<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/refs/heads/master/15c6b96f1234bdba86c7e302c74153525694dca8796163dbb9f52022c002f12e.png\" alt=\"picture 4\">  </p>\n<p>3、OC的设置，只能在redir-host模式走分流<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/refs/heads/master/b9ac2d6ade0b8cff17017b68ece4aaa8ec93a5ac60ac109fa2539862b10a06de.png\" alt=\"picture 5\">  </p>\n<p>4、绕过本机、代理常用端口、绕过大地<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/refs/heads/master/0f7918aa9022a05349419426598172abb0f26c0b7e01bf8468ffa1bb82f79770.png\" alt=\"picture 11\">  </p>\n<p>5、禁用本地，把dns交给mosdns接管<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/refs/heads/master/2d7bebda40dd65c972fb69eaf7071b1837f928d58c958106dbd53281787aa7e8.png\" alt=\"picture 12\">  </p>\n<p>6、勾选自定义上游和遵循，然后nameserver和fallback组只保留两组地址和端口，地址都填127.0.0.1，端口都是mosdns的5335，类型分别选udp和tcp，然后保存并应用</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/refs/heads/master/26c617cf79ef29d8b35b673585d055e3dfce69d80d939fa8db99070e23a0cea5.png\" alt=\"picture 13\">  </p>\n<p>最后就能得到一个比较畅快又干净的网络环境了！！！！！<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/202509271853553.png\" alt=\"picture 14\"></p>\n",
            "tags": [
                "openwrt",
                "mosdns",
                "openclash"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "https://xubiaolin.github.io/2025/05/16/huan-jing-wen-ti/pve-an-zhuang-openwrt/",
            "url": "https://xubiaolin.github.io/2025/05/16/huan-jing-wen-ti/pve-an-zhuang-openwrt/",
            "title": "PVE安装OpenWrt",
            "date_published": "2025-05-16T08:42:27.000Z",
            "content_html": "<h1 id=\"前言\"><a href=\"#前言\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前言\"></a>前言</h1><p>家里有个闲置的笔记本，想用它来搭建一个家庭服务器，可以用来做NAS、软路由、媒体服务器等。<br>我们本次使用PVE来安装OpenWrt，并使用PVE的虚拟机功能来安装OpenWrt。并使用其作为旁路由使用。</p>\n<h1 id=\"安装PVE\"><a href=\"#安装PVE\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"安装PVE\"></a>安装PVE</h1><p>安装官方的教程操作即可，这里就不赘述了。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://pve.proxmox.com/wiki/Main_Page\">https://pve.proxmox.com/wiki/Main_Page</a></p>\n<h1 id=\"安装OpenWrt\"><a href=\"#安装OpenWrt\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"安装OpenWrt\"></a>安装OpenWrt</h1><h2 id=\"下载镜像\"><a href=\"#下载镜像\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"下载镜像\"></a>下载镜像</h2><p>我们使用的骷髅头的X86镜像，下载地址如下：<br><a href=\"https://github.com/DHDAXCW/OpenWRT_x86_x64/releases\">https://github.com/DHDAXCW/OpenWRT_x86_x64/releases</a></p>\n<p>我们可以得到如下文件：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ ll -h</span><br><span class=\"line\">-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 243M May 16 04:32 immortalwrt-x86-64-generic-squashfs-combined-efi.img.gz</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"解压镜像\"><a href=\"#解压镜像\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"解压镜像\"></a>解压镜像</h2><figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">gzip -d immortalwrt-x86-64-generic-squashfs-combined-efi.img.gz </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"导入镜像\"><a href=\"#导入镜像\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"导入镜像\"></a>导入镜像</h2><p><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/182425212ca7e298e90860580b4fe26ab59959c7a4f1677f1292bfdfe61b657b.png\" alt=\"picture 1\">  </p>\n<p>上传后，可以用Shell命令查找文件位置</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">find / -name \"immortalwrt-x86-64-generic-squashfs-combined-efi.img\"</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"安装OpenWrt虚拟机\"><a href=\"#安装OpenWrt虚拟机\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"安装OpenWrt虚拟机\"></a>安装OpenWrt虚拟机</h2><p>创建虚拟机<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/4bbf7ac0a0846d71a283e7f958306f4696f31f1510f74b48b332eae2b97f3305.png\" alt=\"picture 2\">  </p>\n<p>输入名称<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/53caaaef5add2627cd85418c0b15681deb125a60c5beb6ee102c09b5f8a67539.png\" alt=\"picture 3\">  </p>\n<p>不选择介质<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/6b6cf056b1f26e6c2409936f3cc4855cd9cbca582f68af16189a35e3618a83e9.png\" alt=\"picture 4\">  </p>\n<p>默认即可<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/a85866b4c9fe4f83595e04ebc15da60c8fdd60a76831e052acf450d57c07f280.png\" alt=\"picture 5\">  </p>\n<p>不需要磁盘，然后下一步<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/42d25448198c093b39750e41f975eb74b5e413b917bab18678b9ae24a09069c0.png\" alt=\"picture 7\">  </p>\n<p>CPU一个核心即可<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/3f1eba96ceb702a6e9b2c60490dbabfe9b454256d19d9a494122853095a509a4.png\" alt=\"picture 8\">  </p>\n<p>内存1G即可<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/c564a768e58b932917760f4cee626ac0ce006ac271af0d39005346a343851d55.png\" alt=\"picture 9\">  </p>\n<p>网卡根据自己实际情况选择<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/b5a944b3766a75cd43b27ffb233e84afa752e13675ff66d38bf8f3dc5d3512c7.png\" alt=\"picture 10\">  </p>\n<p>最终的配置：<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/c978e07748236723409197943bd6bdce190929635ecfb7df85f9ec4f5f5283ef.png\" alt=\"picture 11\">  </p>\n<h2 id=\"转换镜像\"><a href=\"#转换镜像\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"转换镜像\"></a>转换镜像</h2><p>进入到openwrt镜像的目录，使用命令转换镜像</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">qm importdisk 100 immortalwrt-x86-64-generic-squashfs-combined-efi.img pve-data</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<p>这个id是你创建虚拟机时，虚拟机id，我这里创建的虚拟机id是100</p>\n<p>pve-data是你的存储路径，我这里使用的是pve的本地存储,你需要根据你的实际情况选择，大部分是local-lvm<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/076a22622bfe90db73722ec3b032d6e8e859d8d6dfb1c32ebc7374b7dad003a6.png\" alt=\"picture 12\">  </p>\n<p>执行后，可以看到导入的日志<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/10f1b8f62132d558620a4bed52ccb37355977235d03404d901ce5aea7567c8a5.png\" alt=\"picture 13\">  </p>\n<p>挂载磁盘,回到虚拟机硬件，可以看到一块未使用的磁盘0，点击编辑<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/173f27f19c7d2c240018df9201545f7c67227de88d76bff5ec2e5aaea94a5e1b.png\" alt=\"picture 14\">  </p>\n<p>选择SATA，然后点添加<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/56f2fea89a061e173103d7621373945ad2a3620e11c36a4ea002a3f1fa493d1b.png\" alt=\"picture 15\">  </p>\n<p>添加成功后如下<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/b5753a6de3f5320de90daf9fbf235900509640d5c6e9dc23d62c6aa75c9fe4bc.png\" alt=\"picture 16\">  </p>\n<p>在选项，找到引导顺序，双击，设置stat0为启动顺序的第一位<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/d62a01d5fc8b0150a4fc718b87834d0623d8be613a2f286eaf0066c97d19f5cd.png\" alt=\"picture 17\">  </p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/6426460e5cb5b3a74c9cf956205cd504d5c1316880f3428589e029d989b5ef82.png\" alt=\"picture 18\">  </p>\n<p>点右上角的启动即可开机<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/eb99a8fa79142bb3c6270813f6bc95b9097cc33d700af24c0d4ef3b38ba3563f.png\" alt=\"picture 19\">  </p>\n<h1 id=\"配置OpenWrt\"><a href=\"#配置OpenWrt\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"配置OpenWrt\"></a>配置OpenWrt</h1><p>编辑网络配置文件，修改对应的ip</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">vi /etc/config/network</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<p>修改对应的ip，我这里修改为192.168.11.1</p>\n<p>修改后重启网络</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">/etc/init.d/network restart</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<p>打开浏览器，输入192.168.11.1，可以看到OpenWrt的登录界面<br><img src=\"https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/0793955353b889ea5f3b9d35fea35111081a8001271e3f83b2d302806ffc27be.png\" alt=\"picture 20\">  </p>\n<p>输入密码，默认密码是password</p>\n<h1 id=\"总结\"><a href=\"#总结\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"总结\"></a>总结</h1><p>OpenWrt的安装还是比较简单的，主要就是导入镜像，然后配置网络，然后启动虚拟机即可。</p>\n",
            "tags": [
                "OpenWrt",
                "PVE"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "https://xubiaolin.github.io/2025/04/11/wang-luo-ke-ji/openwrt-an-zhuang-pei-zhi-tailscale/",
            "url": "https://xubiaolin.github.io/2025/04/11/wang-luo-ke-ji/openwrt-an-zhuang-pei-zhi-tailscale/",
            "title": "OpenWrt安装配置Tailscale",
            "date_published": "2025-04-10T16:16:54.000Z",
            "content_html": "<h1 id=\"OpenWrt安装配置Tailscale\"><a href=\"#OpenWrt安装配置Tailscale\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"OpenWrt安装配置Tailscale\"></a>OpenWrt安装配置Tailscale</h1><h2 id=\"什么是Tailscale\"><a href=\"#什么是Tailscale\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"什么是Tailscale\"></a>什么是Tailscale</h2><p>Tailscale就是基于Wireguard的一个联网工具，无需公网地址，通过去中心化，实现各个节点之间点对点的连接.配置简单友好，支持的各类平台和客户端.</p>\n<h2 id=\"Tailscale的优势\"><a href=\"#Tailscale的优势\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Tailscale的优势\"></a>Tailscale的优势</h2><p>对比zerotier和wireguard,tailscale更容易连上官方的中转服务器,webui界面更简单,适合小白上手,并且可以一键更新,不需要公网ip。</p>\n<p>zerotier在没有ipv6的情况下很容易连接不上官方中转服务器导致设备掉线。</p>\n<p>wireguard需要公网ip,配置繁琐而且每次公网ip更换都需要重启wireguard接口。</p>\n<p>Tailscale Derp配置简单，可以在官方后台直接配置，而不像ZeroTier的moon，需要手动添加。</p>\n<h2 id=\"OpenWrt上的配置Tailscale\"><a href=\"#OpenWrt上的配置Tailscale\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"OpenWrt上的配置Tailscale\"></a>OpenWrt上的配置Tailscale</h2><h3 id=\"下载软件\"><a href=\"#下载软件\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"下载软件\"></a>下载软件</h3><p>将Tailscale软件包下载到指定目录。进入tailscale的github releases地址，找到最新的软件包，下载到本地。</p>\n<p>然后使用Winscp工具将下载的软件上传到OpenWrt的/tmp目录下，也可以找到下载链接，直接使用wget命令下载.</p>\n<p>示例命令：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">wget https://github.com/adyanth/openwrt-tailscale-enabler/releases/download/v1.60.0-e428948-autoupdate/openwrt-tailscale-enabler-v1.60.0-e428948-autoupdate.tgz</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"解压缩：\"><a href=\"#解压缩：\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"解压缩：\"></a>解压缩：</h3><figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">tar x -zvC / -f openwrt-tailscale-enabler-v1.60.0-e428948-autoupdate.tgz</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"安装依赖包\"><a href=\"#安装依赖包\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"安装依赖包\"></a>安装依赖包</h3><figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">opkg update</span><br><span class=\"line\">opkg install libustream-openssl ca-bundle kmod-tun</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"设置开机启动，验证开机启动是否成功\"><a href=\"#设置开机启动，验证开机启动是否成功\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"设置开机启动，验证开机启动是否成功\"></a>设置开机启动，验证开机启动是否成功</h3><figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">/etc/init.d/tailscale enable</span><br><span class=\"line\">ls /etc/rc.d/S*tailscale*</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"启动tailscale\"><a href=\"#启动tailscale\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"启动tailscale\"></a>启动tailscale</h3><figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">/etc/init.d/tailscale start</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"获取登录链接并配置路由\"><a href=\"#获取登录链接并配置路由\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"获取登录链接并配置路由\"></a>获取登录链接并配置路由</h3><figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">tailscale up</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/xubiaolin/picgo@master/0b21ac58c225cc714d757c1c74c483c4d66c7a754f25ac4a99ca69b18d7cdf21.png\" alt=\"picture 0\">  </p>\n<p>复制显示的地址，并在浏览器中打开，使用谷歌或微软帐号登录Tailscale的管理主页进行验证。<br> 不建议使用谷歌账号,因为使用谷歌后你手机在外面链接需要先开科学再登录谷歌账号才能链接上tailscale的app.</p>\n<h3 id=\"开启子网路由\"><a href=\"#开启子网路由\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"开启子网路由\"></a>开启子网路由</h3><p>在OpenWrt上输入以下命令，打开本地子路由。子网地址是OpenWrt的lan网络。192.168.11.0/24是我的子网,不要无脑复制我的!!!!!</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">tailscale up --accept-routes --accept-dns=false --advertise-routes=192.168.11.0/24</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n<p>在Tailscale的管理页面上，单击设备列表右侧的更多图标，禁用密钥过期，并打开子网路由。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/xubiaolin/picgo@master/31787ab2a9a34e778f359e8e02de51a55c944f3302301fa6730c40925de43bd4.png\" alt=\"picture 1\">  </p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/xubiaolin/picgo@master/2f7d55c9e63b03c85f3b2540a6193b8dcb26b5bbfb4a7d3ac11370cfb890cd38.png\" alt=\"picture 2\">  </p>\n<h3 id=\"添加Tailscale接口\"><a href=\"#添加Tailscale接口\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"添加Tailscale接口\"></a>添加Tailscale接口</h3><p>现在在OpenWrt上已经可以ping通其他Tailscale节点了，但其他节点还无法连接OpenWrt节点，还需要在OpenWrt上添加Tailscale接口。</p>\n<p>在OpenWrt上新建一个接口，协议选静态地址，设备选tailscale0，地址为Taliscale管理页面上分配的地址，掩码255.0.0.0。防火墙区域选lan区域。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/xubiaolin/picgo@master/1416664fad80fd03575313b0f994b6c259c7efe4b0225ca49c01d2b2401810fd.png\" alt=\"picture 3\">  </p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/xubiaolin/picgo@master/afc88d82a37faa58fbc0bb1091e62153a9935a7a436f1cc790e2b7742bd568c2.png\" alt=\"picture 4\">  </p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/xubiaolin/picgo@master/3192a5a1f18db4ba4bebaf5d867780a31b1906f67ebc4c5f50bc7cff43e18b50.png\" alt=\"picture 5\">  </p>\n<h2 id=\"测试\"><a href=\"#测试\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"测试\"></a>测试</h2><p>在另一个设备访问<a href=\"http://192.168.11.1/\">http://192.168.11.1</a> ，如果可以访问，则说明配置成功。<br>ps：这里的192.168.11.1是我的OpenWrt的ip地址，不要无脑复制我的。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/xubiaolin/picgo@master/b6b396b92783834191aab87cd5c7c8eb612f5429b209fee24b8ec9f8cf21387e.png\" alt=\"picture 6\">  </p>\n",
